abstract: >-
  Research software, safety-gated reproducibility interfaces, and frozen
  evidence supporting the canonical manuscript “A Multi-Axis Validation
  Framework for Machine-Learning Intrusion Detection.” Stage 28 is the final
  empirical wall; current public interfaces expose static and non-scientific
  verification rather than unrestricted experiment execution.
